Input: {"question": "Which person or organization did John Mcferran work for?", "original_source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 0, "end": 96, "text": "**Rome-Based Researcher John Mcferran Makes Groundbreaking Discovery at Tor Vergata University**"}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 98, "end": 354, "text": "Rome, Italy - In a breakthrough that is sending shockwaves through the scientific community, renowned researcher John Mcferran has made a significant discovery at Tor Vergata University of Rome, where he has been working tirelessly for the past five years."}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 355, "end": 472, "text": "Mcferran, a leading expert in his field, has been studying the effects of climate change on Mediterranean ecosystems."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 473, "end": 663, "text": "His latest research, published in the prestigious journal Nature, reveals a previously unknown correlation between rising temperatures and the decline of certain plant species in the region."}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 664, "end": 818, "text": "\"We've been monitoring the situation for years, but the data we've collected is staggering,\" Mcferran said in an exclusive interview with our publication."}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 819, "end": 943, "text": "\"The rate at which these plants are disappearing is unprecedented, and it's clear that human activity is the primary cause.\""}, "D1S7": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 944, "end": 1129, "text": "Mcferran's research team, comprised of scientists from Tor Vergata University and several international institutions, has been conducting extensive fieldwork in the Italian countryside."}, "D1S8": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1130, "end": 1279, "text": "Their findings suggest that the region's unique biodiversity is under threat, with potentially devastating consequences for the ecosystem as a whole."}, "D1S9": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1280, "end": 1342, "text": "\"The implications of this research are far-reaching,\" said Dr."}, "D1S10": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1343, "end": 1413, "text": "Maria Rossi, Dean of the Faculty of Science at Tor Vergata University."}, "D1S11": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1414, "end": 1530, "text": "\"John's work has shed new light on the urgent need for sustainable practices and conservation efforts in our region."}, "D1S12": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1531, "end": 1594, "text": "We're proud to have him as a member of our academic community.\""}, "D1S13": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1595, "end": 1764, "text": "According to Mcferran's research, the past decade has seen a 30% decline in the population of certain plant species, with some areas experiencing a decline of up to 50%."}, "D1S14": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1765, "end": 1917, "text": "The data, collected from over 100 sampling sites across Italy, paints a dire picture of the impact of climate change on the region's delicate ecosystem."}, "D1S15": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1918, "end": 1974, "text": "\"This is a wake-up call for all of us,\" Mcferran warned."}, "D1S16": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1975, "end": 2077, "text": "\"We need to take immediate action to reduce our carbon footprint and protect these fragile ecosystems."}, "D1S17": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2078, "end": 2118, "text": "The future of our planet depends on it.\""}, "D1S18": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2119, "end": 2254, "text": "Mcferran's discovery has sparked widespread interest in the scientific community, with many experts hailing it as a major breakthrough."}, "D1S19": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2255, "end": 2424, "text": "As the international community continues to grapple with the challenges of climate change, Mcferran's research serves as a timely reminder of the urgent need for action."}, "D1S20": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2425, "end": 2553, "text": "Tor Vergata University of Rome, one of Italy's top-ranked institutions, has a long history of producing groundbreaking research."}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 0, "end": 54, "text": "Here is a potential Wikipedia entry for John Mcferran:"}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 56, "end": 69, "text": "John Mcferran"}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 71, "end": 209, "text": "John Mcferran is a researcher who has made significant contributions to his field through his work at the University of Western Australia."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 210, "end": 216, "text": "Career"}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 218, "end": 355, "text": "Mcferran worked as a researcher at the University of Western Australia, a public research university located in Perth, Western Australia."}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 356, "end": 514, "text": "During his tenure at the university, he was involved in various research projects and collaborations that advanced the understanding of his area of expertise."}, "D2S7": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 515, "end": 632, "text": "Evidence of Mcferran's affiliation with the University of Western Australia can be found in several credible sources."}, "D2S8": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 633, "end": 810, "text": "According to his profile on ResearchGate, a social networking site for scientists and researchers, Mcferran lists the University of Western Australia as one of his affiliations."}, "D2S9": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 811, "end": 979, "text": "[1] Additionally, a search of the university's staff directory reveals Mcferran's name and contact information, further confirming his association with the institution."}, "D2S10": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 980, "end": 983, "text": "[2]"}, "D2S11": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 985, "end": 1118, "text": "Mcferran's research output during his time at the University of Western Australia is also a testament to his work at the institution."}, "D2S12": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1119, "end": 1302, "text": "A search of academic databases such as Scopus and Web of Science reveals several publications authored by Mcferran, with the University of Western Australia listed as his affiliation."}, "D2S13": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1303, "end": 1309, "text": "[3][4]"}, "D2S14": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1311, "end": 1322, "text": "References:"}, "D2S15": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1324, "end": 1341, "text": "[1] ResearchGate."}, "D2S16": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1342, "end": 1349, "text": "(n.d.)."}, "D2S17": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1350, "end": 1364, "text": "John Mcferran."}, "D2S18": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1365, "end": 1436, "text": "Retrieved from <https:\\/\\/www.researchgate.net\\/profile\\/John_Mcferran>"}, "D2S19": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1438, "end": 1474, "text": "[2] University of Western Australia."}, "D2S20": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1475, "end": 1482, "text": "(n.d.)."}, "D2S21": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1483, "end": 1499, "text": "Staff Directory."}, "D2S22": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1500, "end": 1552, "text": "Retrieved from <https:\\/\\/www.uwa.edu.au\\/directory>"}, "D2S23": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1554, "end": 1565, "text": "[3] Scopus."}, "D2S24": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id