h these plants are disappearing is unprecedented, and it's clear that human activity is the primary cause.\" Mcferran's research team, comprised of scientists from Tor Vergata University and several international institutions, has been conducting extensive fieldwork in the Italian countryside. Their findings suggest that the region's unique biodiversity is under threat, with potentially devastating consequences for the ecosystem as a whole. \"The implications of this research are far-reaching,\" said Dr. Maria Rossi, Dean of the Faculty of Science at Tor Vergata University. \"John's work has shed new light on the urgent need for sustainable practices and conservation efforts in our region. We're proud to have him as a member of our academic community.\"", "original_document_number": 1}], "current_answers": ["Tor Vergata University", "University of Western Australia", "Tor Vergata University of Rome", "several international institutions", "ResearchGate", "Scopus", "Web of Science", "Faculty of Science at Tor Vergata University", "Italian countryside", "Perth, Western Australia", "Mediterranean ecosystems", "Italy"], "candidate_answers": [{"candidate_id": "R0", "answer": "Tor Vergata University", "origin": "initial"}, {"candidate_id": "R1", "answer": "University of Western Australia", "origin": "initial"}, {"candidate_id": "R2", "answer": "Tor Vergata University of Rome", "origin": "coverage_addition"}, {"candidate_id": "R3", "answer": "several international institutions", "origin": "coverage_addition"}, {"candidate_id": "R4", "answer": "ResearchGate", "origin": "coverage_addition"}, {"candidate_id": "R5", "answer": "Scopus", "origin": "coverage_addition"}, {"candidate_id": "R6", "answer": "Web of Science", "origin": "coverage_addition"}, {"candidate_id": "R7", "answer": "Faculty of Science at Tor Vergata University", "origin": "coverage_addition"}, {"candidate_id": "R8", "answer": "Italian countryside", "origin": "coverage_addition"}, {"candidate_id": "R9", "answer":